      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results in the development of computer methods of assessment of patient state are presented as tasks of; diagnostics, gravity of disease assessment, selection of treatment based upon analysis of alternatives, forecast of the patient's state. Practice-oriented PC-based inquiry-consulting system is given as a result of this study. The system combines clinical data base and analysis functions, including the elements of artificial intelligence techniques in a user-friendly interface."},
